# Change workflow

- Treat `NOTES.md` and external reports as proposals, not contracts.
- Start with one typed job and one bounded read/edit/check/preview loop.
- Do not pre-create services, packages, brokers, or provider layers without a
  real caller and acceptance evidence.
- Tool denial, timeout, cancellation, and false-success prevention are part of
  the first implementation, not later polish.
- Remove replaced paths or document their authority, owner, and removal trigger.
